      "example_text": "Input: board = [[-3,1,1,1],[-3,1,-3,1],[-3,2,1,1]]\nOutput: 4\nExplanation:\n\nWe can place the rooks in the cells (0, 2) , (1, 3) , and (2, 1) for a sum of 1 + 1 + 2 = 4 .",
